# Wave T34 (Highbranch kit): bunting — a festival bunting strand:
# two short posts strung with a sagging line of pennant flags in
# the gym's colours (red, gold, blue). The painting and the
# design manifest name the Highbranch Gym the 'bunting hall';
# the stamp facade is byte-preserved, so the bunting dresses its
# approach — a pair flanks the walkway spine's head at (13,5)
# and (18,5), the sunlamp-pair precedent. Fully opaque, town
# grass baked in (measured #118612 / #115012).
